 [{:file "project-plan.recdep.edn"
   :title "Project plan"
   :about "Resources, roles and tasks in, and a plan out, built from blocks: a working calendar, a timesheet, a scheduler, named baselines to compare two at a time, tracking with earned value, a Gantt, two loading views and how sure its finish is (Schedule risk: the plan worked out 300 times, each task's work drawn between its least and most), each saying what it takes and gives. Tasks ask for named people, for any one of a role's people, or for whoever got another task. It opens on its facade, the plan as its team sees it; Advanced, in the toolbar, shows the workings."}
