   :about "A wholesaler's customers, products and orders, kept in the sheet's own database (400 customers, 3,000 orders), with sheets that are forms onto it: find customers or orders, open one, type over its details to change them, add and remove an order's lines, and follow links from an order to its customer and back. Its shapes say what each table holds."}
  {:file "share-portfolio.recdep.edn"
